      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-24T18:28:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yeah, I think you\u0027re right. Can you add that description? I think calling out what exactly the PDU is, is important.",
      "parentUuid": "b7a29f40_a1de5dad",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 19,
